<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed mixed in heavy trading Tuesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 10.44 to 6266.04, a record.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 0.65 to 386.18.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.07.</p>
<p>Gainers beat losers 1325 to 1102.</p>
<p>Volume was 471,743,060, compared with 353,958,870 Monday.</p>
